<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!-- Shared form components of website 4 (audit 2026-10-11). Other modules call them; keep the parameter names stable.

         1. ts_website.jdate - Solar Hijri date field (replaces <input type="date">, which shows a Gregorian mm/dd/yyyy picker)
              <t t-call="ts_website.jdate" jd_name.f="deadline" jd_id.f="inv_deadline" jd_label.f="مهلت پاسخ"
                 jd_value="invite.deadline" jd_hint.f="اختیاری" jd_required="True"/>
            Static strings MUST use the .f suffix (jd_name.f="deadline"): a plain attribute is evaluated as a Python
            expression, so jd_name="deadline" would read a variable named deadline. Use the plain form only for
            expressions (jd_value="invite.deadline").
            jd_name      form field name; a hidden input with this name posts ISO yyyy-mm-dd (filled by ts_nav.js)
            jd_id        id of the visible input (the label points at it)
            jd_label     label text
            jd_value     ISO date string, a date, or False (prefilled server-side as ۱۴۰۵/۰۷/۲۰)
            jd_hint      optional hint text, shown before the format example
            jd_required  optional truthy
            The visible input is named <jd_name>_jalali, so the form also works without JavaScript. Read both with
            odoo.addons.ts_website.tools.parse_jdate(post.get(jd_name), post.get(jd_name + '_jalali')).

         2. ts_website.filefield - Persian file picker (the native control says «Choose File / No file chosen»)
              <t t-call="ts_website.filefield" ff_name.f="logo" ff_id.f="set_logo" ff_label.f="لوگو"
                 ff_accept.f="image/png,image/jpeg" ff_hint.f="PNG یا JPG، تا ۶۰۰ کیلوبایت"/>
            ff_name, ff_id, ff_label, ff_accept (optional), ff_hint (optional), ff_required (optional truthy)
            With JavaScript the native input is visually hidden but stays focusable; a button «انتخاب فایل» and a live
            line («فایلی انتخاب نشده» / the file name) are shown. Without JavaScript the native input is shown.
            ts_nav.js also upgrades any bare <input type="file"> on website 4 the same way.

         3. ts_website.auth_choices - sign-in choice on entry pages (/invite, /c, /join; audit G1 PT-3): one primary for
            the mobile number, the e-mail account as a quiet text link (not three equal buttons).
              <t t-call="ts_website.auth_choices" phone_url="urls['phone_url']" login_url="urls['login_url']"
                 signup_url="urls.get('signup_url')"/>
            only.f="phone" / only.f="email" (or only="expr"): show just the method a colleague invite is bound to.

         4. ts_website.sep - separator between parts of a meta line (UX audit 2026-10-12, G6-PT1):
              <t t-out="when"/><t t-call="ts_website.sep"/><t t-out="fa(n)"/> سنجه
            A drawn dot (.ts-sep), never the « · » glyph: next to a Persian digit the middle dot reads as zero
            («۲ · سنجه» looked like «۲۰ سنجه»). Screen readers hear «، ». In a long headline put counts on their own line.

         5. ts_website.state_card - a participant link that leads nowhere today (invitation expired, withdrawn, declined,
            panel paused; open link closed or full; colleague invite no longer valid). One card, always with a next step
            (UX T7 X1): what happened (sc_title), what to do (sc_text), an optional fact (sc_note, e.g. the expiry date),
            and one button: signed in -> sc_label / sc_href (default «سنجه‌ها و نتیجه‌ها», /my/assessments); signed out ->
            «ورود» to sc_login (default /signup?next=/my/assessments).
              <t t-call="ts_website.state_card" sc_title="card['title']" sc_text="card['text']" sc_note="card['note']"
                 sc_public="public"/> -->
    <record id="tpl_jdate" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">TS: Solar Hijri date field</field>
        <field name="type">qweb</field>
        <field name="key">ts_website.jdate</field>
        <field name="website_id" ref="website_ts"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <t t-name="ts_website.jdate">
                <t t-set="jd_shown" t-value="website.ts_jalali_str(jd_value) if jd_value else ''"/>
                <div class="ts-jdate" data-ts-jdate="1">
                    <label t-att-for="jd_id" class="ts-jdate__label"><t t-out="jd_label"/><span t-if="jd_required" class="ts-sr"> (لازم)</span></label>
                    <input type="text" class="ts-input ts-jdate__input" t-att-id="jd_id" t-att-name="'%s_jalali' % jd_name" t-att-value="jd_shown"
                           inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="off" dir="ltr" maxlength="12"
                           t-att-required="'required' if jd_required else None" t-att-aria-describedby="'%s_hint %s_out' % (jd_id, jd_id)"/>
                    <input type="hidden" class="ts-jdate__iso" t-att-name="jd_name" t-att-value="jd_value or ''"/>
                    <p class="ts-hint ts-jdate__hint" t-att-id="'%s_hint' % jd_id"><t t-if="jd_hint"><t t-out="jd_hint"/><t t-call="ts_website.sep"/></t>سال/ماه/روز خورشیدی، مثل ۱۴۰۵/۰۷/۲۰</p>
                    <p class="ts-jdate__out" t-att-id="'%s_out' % jd_id" aria-live="polite"><t t-if="jd_value" t-out="website.ts_jalali_str(jd_value, True)"/></p>
                </div>
            </t>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="tpl_sep" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">TS: meta-line separator</field>
        <field name="type">qweb</field>
        <field name="key">ts_website.sep</field>
        <field name="website_id" ref="website_ts"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <t t-name="ts_website.sep"><span class="ts-sep"><span class="ts-sr">، </span></span></t>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="tpl_filefield" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">TS: file picker</field>
        <field name="type">qweb</field>
        <field name="key">ts_website.filefield</field>
        <field name="website_id" ref="website_ts"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <t t-name="ts_website.filefield">
                <div class="ts-file" data-ts-file="1">
                    <label t-att-for="ff_id" class="ts-file__label" t-out="ff_label"/>
                    <span class="ts-file__row">
                        <!-- the real input lies over the visible button: the tap target is the button's 44 px, no script needed to open it -->
                        <span class="ts-file__pick">
                            <input type="file" class="ts-file__input" t-att-id="ff_id" t-att-name="ff_name" t-att-accept="ff_accept or None"
                                   t-att-required="'required' if ff_required else None"
                                   t-att-aria-describedby="('%s_name' % ff_id) + ((' %s_hint' % ff_id) if ff_hint else '')"/>
                            <span class="ts-btn ts-btn--outline ts-file__btn" aria-hidden="true">انتخاب فایل</span>
                        </span>
                        <span class="ts-file__name" t-att-id="'%s_name' % ff_id" aria-live="polite">فایلی انتخاب نشده</span>
                    </span>
                    <p t-if="ff_hint" class="ts-hint ts-file__hint" t-att-id="'%s_hint' % ff_id" t-out="ff_hint"/>
                </div>
            </t>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="tpl_state_card" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">TS: participant state card</field>
        <field name="type">qweb</field>
        <field name="key">ts_website.state_card</field>
        <field name="website_id" ref="website_ts"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <t t-name="ts_website.state_card">
                <div class="ts-card ts-card--soft ts-state" role="status" id="ts-state-card">
                    <h2 class="h5" t-out="sc_title"/>
                    <p t-out="sc_text"/>
                    <p t-if="sc_note" class="ts-hint" t-out="sc_note"/>
                    <div class="ts-state__actions">
                        <a t-if="sc_public" t-att-href="sc_login or '/signup?next=/my/assessments'" class="ts-btn ts-btn--primary">ورود</a>
                        <a t-else="" t-att-href="sc_href or '/my/assessments'" class="ts-btn ts-btn--primary" t-out="sc_label or 'سنجه‌ها و نتیجه‌ها'"/>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </t>
        </field>
    </record>

    <record id="tpl_auth_choices" model="ir.ui.view">
        <field name="name">TS: sign-in choices</field>
        <field name="type">qweb</field>
        <field name="key">ts_website.auth_choices</field>
        <field name="website_id" ref="website_ts"/>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <t t-name="ts_website.auth_choices">
                <div class="ts-authchoice">
                    <t t-if="only == 'email'">
                        <a t-if="login_url" t-att-href="login_url" class="ts-btn ts-btn--primary ts-btn--lg ts-btn--block">ورود با ایمیل</a>
                    </t>
                    <t t-elif="phone_url">
                        <a t-att-href="phone_url" class="ts-btn ts-btn--primary ts-btn--lg ts-btn--block">ورود یا ثبت‌نام با موبایل</a>
                        <p t-if="login_url and not only" class="ts-authchoice__alt">
                            <a t-att-href="login_url">با ایمیل ثبت‌نام کرده بودید؟</a>
                        </p>
                    </t>
                    <t t-elif="not only">
                        <!-- no mobile sign-in on this site yet: e-mail sign-up is the primary, sign-in the text link -->
                        <a t-if="signup_url" t-att-href="signup_url" class="ts-btn ts-btn--primary ts-btn--lg ts-btn--block">ساخت حساب</a>
                        <p t-if="login_url" class="ts-authchoice__alt"><a t-att-href="login_url">حساب دارم؛ ورود</a></p>
                    </t>
                </div>
            </t>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
